-- CoA Custom races: the race bits the package (CoA Custom 1.5.1, quest_template_add) adds to the quests of
-- the base races, so the added races see the quests of their faction and home race. Only the bits of the
-- added races (9 and 12-32; ids 33-63 share them) are ORed in; quests open to every race stay at 0.
-- Quests the package does not know that are still open to exactly one faction (690 Horde, 1101 Alliance)
-- get the added races of that faction.
